  "result": "I've found the archive tickets that match, and I'm writing up the answer now.\n\n{\"seen_before\": true, \"matches\": [\"PowerToys#26\", \"PowerToys#46189\", \"PowerToys#44917\"], \"answer\": \"This request has been filed many times. The PowerToys team tracks it in PowerToys#26, \\\"SyncToy and Robocopy\\\", and has closed the other requests as duplicates of it. Those include #46189, #44917 and #32600. Add a thumbs-up to #26 and any specific needs, such as long path support, scheduling, or one-way or two-way sync. A new ticket won't add anything. The tickets show no plan to bring SyncToy back. A maintainer said in #32098 that SyncToy was never a PowerToys utility, and Microsoft has withdrawn the official download. In the meantime, use an alternative. Robocopy is built into Windows. WinMerge was suggested in #14204. #45270 proposes a new open-source SyncToy-style tool called ReStore.\"}",
